{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1476185-any-new-ideas-for-mini-realms-in-the-umbra","id":1476185,"title":"any new ideas for Mini-Realms in the Umbra","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-10T18:58:12-08:00","id":1476185,"title":"any new ideas for Mini-Realms in the Umbra","content":"I was recently rereading Umbra: the Velvet Shadow and across the section on mini-realms. They are basically an anomaly in the Umbra, separate from any other power in the Umbra, but still connected by Moon Paths and spirit trails. It's basically a concept that let's the ST do whatever wild thing they want in the Umbra and not have to worry about how it fits with the rest of the cosmology.<br /> <br /> The only example ever given is &quot;the Beast&quot; which seems to be a colossal crinos figure with Garou being the relative size of fleas to it. It's a nice, brief little strangeness for the ST to add during a spirit trip.<br /> <br /> Does anyone have any ideas for other mini-realms? Have you ever seen them used in game? Hoping to hear some brainstorming ideas. I'd like to write down some neat ideas I can use when running the Umbra itself. I'm trying to improve how I ST the Umbra in my chronicles, and this is an aspect I've completely neglected before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-11T07:28:08-08:00","id":1476207,"title":"","content":"The umbra book for W20 mention a mini realm which is basiquely a web browser for the umbra. You stand on a disk, you ask what you want, step on another disk, precise your demand and so on until the place leads you to where you asked to be","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-11T14:33:04-08:00","id":1476227,"title":"","content":"The \u201c1001 Interesting Paradox Backlashes\u201d thread in the Ascension subforum has inspirational Paradox Realms. They aren\u2019t Werewolf-y, but they do fit the \u2018weird anomaly\u2019 direction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}